  - ID: tutorial.Welcome
    Text: "Dinle bakal\u0131m, \u00e7aylak! Bira kendi kendine mayalan\u0131yor ama buhar\u0131... \u00e7al\u0131\u015fanlar\u0131m\u0131n ba\u015f\u0131n\u0131 d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcyor. \u0130\u015fte buradalar..."
  - ID: tutorial.Characters
    Text: "\u00dc\u00e7l\u00fcn: Barmen biray\u0131 haz\u0131rlar, Garson ta\u015f\u0131r, G\u00fcvenlik g\u00f6revlisi d\u0131\u015far\u0131 atar. Buhar ba\u015flar\u0131n\u0131 d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcyor \u2014 onlara imlecinle yol g\u00f6stermelisin."
  - ID: tutorial.ShowUITimer
    Text: "Vardiyan ba\u015flad\u0131. Buhar iyice yo\u011funla\u015fmadan t\u00fcm misafirlere hizmet et!"
  - ID: tutorial.CreateBarrel
    Text: "F\u0131\u00e7\u0131lar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca BARMEN sipari\u015f edebilir. Git birka\u00e7 tane sipari\u015f et!"
  - ID: tutorial.TakeBarrel
    Text: "F\u0131\u00e7\u0131lar\u0131 kap!"
  - ID: tutorial.MoveBarrel
    Text: "\u00c7abuk, onlar\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131!"
  - ID: tutorial.ShowUIVisitorAmount
    Text: "Sayac\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcyor musun? S\u00fcre dolmadan hizmet etmen gereken misafirleri g\u00f6steriyor."
  - ID: tutorial.BuildTable
    Text: "Misafirler yere oturmaz. Hana masa ekle."
  - ID: tutorial.WaitVisitor
    Text: "Misafirler fazla beklemez. \u00c7ABUK! Uykuya dalmadan sipari\u015fi getir!"
  - ID: tutorial.SelectedWaiter
    Text: "Misafirler fazla beklemez. \u00c7ABUK, \u0130\u00c7ECEKLER\u0130N\u0130 GET\u0130R!"
  - ID: tutorial.CreateBeer
    Text: "\u00c7ABUK G\u0130T, \u0130\u00c7ECEK DOLDUR!"
  - ID: tutorial.TakeBeer
    Text: "KUPAYI KAP!"
  - ID: tutorial.ServesesVisitor
    Text: "KO\u015e! KO\u015e! Olabildi\u011fince h\u0131zl\u0131!"
  - ID: tutorial.GiveBeer
    Text: "\u0130\u00e7ece\u011fi ve paray\u0131 ayn\u0131 anda ta\u015f\u0131yamazs\u0131n. \u0130\u00e7ece\u011fi masaya b\u0131rak."
  - ID: tutorial.TakeMoney
    Text: "Alt\u0131nlar\u0131 topla."
  - ID: tutorial.GiveMoney
    Text: "ALTINLARI SANDI\u011eA g\u00f6t\u00fcr."
  - ID: tutorial.ShowUIMoneyAmout
    Text: "EVET! Zengin oluyoruz!"
  - ID: tutorial.SleepVisitors
    Text: "\u0130\u015fte \u015fimdi uykuya dald\u0131."
  - ID: tutorial.SelectedSecuryte
    Text: "G\u00fcvenlik g\u00f6revlisini se\u00e7."
  - ID: tutorial.TakeVisitor
    Text: "Uyuyan misafiri kald\u0131r, s\u0131radakine yer a\u00e7!"
  - ID: tutorial.GiveVisitor
    Text: "Onu DI\u015eARI at!"
  - ID: tutorial.LastStep
    Text: "Hepsi bu! Vardiyan\u0131 tamamla."
